      "marker": "6",
      "text": "6. Global Studies Major Courses (9 hours): Select 9 hours from the following: GLST 220, GLST 300, GLST 305 or GEOG 305, GLST 308 or FAME 308, GLST 320 or GEOG 320, GLST 370, GLST 380 or GEOG 380, GLST 391, GLST 531; EDFI 361.",
